### Create client
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/client HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NEWCLIENT",
  "displayName": "New Client"
}

### Bulk create clients (idempotent — re-send safe)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/client/bulk HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{PARTNER_API_KEY}}

{
  "clients": [
    { "code": "JASCLIENT1", "displayName": "Jasleen Client 1", "enableFXGTOM": true },
    { "code": "JASCLIENT2", "displayName": "Jasleen Client 2", "enableFXGTOM": false }
  ]
}

### Toggle enableFXGTOM for a client
PATCH http://localhost:7015/api/v1/client/BZT/enableFXGTOM HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{PARTNER_API_KEY}}

{
  "enableFXGTOM": false
}

### Error: duplicate client code
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/client HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "BZT"
}

### Error: missing code
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/client HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "No code"
}

### List all clients (no pagination)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/client/all HTTP/1.1

### List clients (paginated)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/client?pageNum=1&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1

### Search clients by code
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/client?q=BZ&pageNum=1&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1

### Get a client by code
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/client/BZT HTTP/1.1

### Update csvConfig for a client
PATCH http://localhost:7015/api/v1/client/BZT/csvConfig HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "csvConfig": {
    "columns": {
      "FX_Category": {
        "required": true
      },
      "FX_Gender": {
        "required": true,
        "allowedValues": [
          "Male",
          "Female",
          "Unisex"
        ]
      },
      "barcode": {
        "sources": [
          "barcode",
          "Item EAN Code"
        ],
        "required": true
      }
    }
  }
}

### Error: client not found
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/client/UNKNOWN HTTP/1.1
